      <section id="story" class="section">
        <div class="shell story">
          <div class="reveal">
            <h2>Shopping should be experiential, not transactional</h2>
            <div class="story-body">
              <p>ERBA is an evolution in aesthetic and function, and what we think a dispensary should be. The choices are many and the quality of every product is held to the same standard. Everything inside is curated, from the store design to the assortment. There is an intention to everything you see.</p>
              <p>Whether it is CBD oil, edibles, pens or top shelf flower, we keep looking for new and exceptional brands and we keep catering to what you actually need. Our staff come from different corners of this industry and are trained to give you a straight answer.</p>
              <p>No one should feel rushed or treated like a transaction. Every customer is different and gets treated that way. Word of mouth is our best asset, because it is the community that matters to us. The purchase is easy. The visit is what you remember.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <figure class="story-figure reveal" style="margin-block: 0;">
